meta {
  name: Update Entry
  type: http
  seq: 4
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/parlance.v1.EntryService/UpdateEntry
  body: json
  auth: inherit
}

headers {
  Content-Type: application/json
}

body:json {
  {
    "id": "{{entryId}}",
    "key": "button.cancel",
    "description": "Updated cancel button label"
  }
}

docs {
  # Update Entry

  Updates an existing translation entry.

  ## Authentication
  Requires valid access token. User ID is automatically tracked as updater.

  ## Request
  - `id` (required): The UUID of the entry to update
  - `key` (optional): Updated entry key
  - `description` (optional): Updated description

  ## Behavior
  - Only provided fields will be updated
  - UpdatedBy is automatically set from authenticated user
  - To update scopes, use ScopeService endpoints

  ## Response
  Returns the updated entry.

  ## Example Response
  ```json
  {
    "entry": {
      "id": "uuid",
      "key": "button.cancel",
      "description": "Updated cancel button label",
      "createdAt": "2026-03-27T19:05:00+01:00",
      "updatedAt": "2026-03-27T19:10:00+01:00",
      "createdBy": "user-uuid",
      "updatedBy": "user-uuid",
      "localizations": [...],
      "scopes": [...]
    }
  }
  ```

  ## Errors
  - `INVALID_ARGUMENT`: entry id is required
  - `NOT_FOUND`: entry not found
  - `INTERNAL`: failed to update entry
}
